1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twenty-Eighth Episode
The Iron Lion

15
00:01:51,341 --> 00:01:55,380
Sapphire, blinded,
was taken away by Satan.

16
00:01:56,221 --> 00:02:00,612
But then, saved by Zelda,
she learned that the King and the Queen...

17
00:02:00,661 --> 00:02:04,859
...were on the Island of Serpents,
transformed into stone statues.

18
00:02:05,221 --> 00:02:08,019
While trying to save them,
she fell into the sea.

19
00:02:08,341 --> 00:02:10,730
She is saved by the pirate Blood.

20
00:02:11,181 --> 00:02:14,890
With him, she goes to the Magic Spring
to heal her eyes.

21
00:02:15,221 --> 00:02:19,533
Thanks to the magic water of the
spring, she regains her sight...

22
00:02:19,901 --> 00:02:23,974
...and with the pirate Blood's ship
she sets off for Coolland...

23
00:02:24,061 --> 00:02:26,495
..to fight
Queen Icicle.

24
00:02:27,341 --> 00:02:31,016
And now, enjoy
"The Iron Lion."

25
00:03:35,861 --> 00:03:38,978
The Island of Serpents!
There is the Island of Serpents!

26
00:03:41,941 --> 00:03:44,011
Father...
Mother...

27
00:04:03,261 --> 00:04:06,731
Here I am, safe and sound,
thanks to your protection...

28
00:04:06,821 --> 00:04:09,813
...and that of a friend
once helped.

29
00:04:14,461 --> 00:04:16,691
You know how much I want to help you

30
00:04:16,741 --> 00:04:19,813
but even if I came there,
now I could do nothing for you.

31
00:04:20,381 --> 00:04:22,895
Without the help of Satan
I cannot break...

32
00:04:22,941 --> 00:04:25,819
...this infamous spell
that holds you prisoner.

33
00:04:25,901 --> 00:04:29,894
Now I must try to thwart
the plans of Queen Icicle,

34
00:04:29,941 --> 00:04:32,501
sovereign of Coolland.
And I must hurry!

35
00:04:32,621 --> 00:04:35,931
Wait until I have
accomplished this. Be patient!

36
00:04:49,741 --> 00:04:52,096
Listen, father, mother...

37
00:04:53,901 --> 00:04:58,338
You'll see that I will soon defeat
the damned Queen Icicle!

38
00:05:22,021 --> 00:05:25,172
Take something to offer as a tribute
to Queen Icicle!

39
00:05:25,221 --> 00:05:27,018
Yes, sir!

40
00:05:28,821 --> 00:05:31,415
- If you take this away from me...
- That! Give it to me!

41
00:05:31,781 --> 00:05:35,456
No... Please!
Leave it to me!

42
00:05:36,301 --> 00:05:39,976
- Give it back to me!
- Grandpa! Grandpa!

43
00:05:43,501 --> 00:05:46,857
Make way! Queen Popsicle is
waiting for us! Let's go, quickly!

44
00:05:49,421 --> 00:05:52,333
- What a shame!
- It's not possible!

45
00:05:53,101 --> 00:05:56,730
Dammit! Take it to the
Queen with my compliments!

46
00:05:58,621 --> 00:06:00,896
They come day and night
to steal the merchandise...

47
00:06:00,941 --> 00:06:03,501
...and they always steal from
me because it's the finest!

48
00:06:05,021 --> 00:06:07,012
What thieves!

49
00:06:12,021 --> 00:06:14,251
Hello! Good morning everyone!

50
00:06:17,380 --> 00:06:21,215
This fruit looks delicious. Tell
me, how much does it cost?

51
00:06:21,420 --> 00:06:26,176
You want to know how much it costs? Well,
then you aren't one of those from the castle!

52
00:06:26,220 --> 00:06:29,372
No, indeed!
I am the ghost knight!

53
00:06:29,460 --> 00:06:32,658
The ghost knight!
Welcome!

54
00:06:32,700 --> 00:06:36,933
For you, this fruit is the best
and cheapest in all of Coolland!

55
00:06:37,340 --> 00:06:40,014
And what would be different
if I came from the castle?

56
00:06:40,100 --> 00:06:42,376
I'll tell you, ghost knight!

57
00:06:42,620 --> 00:06:45,533
The Queen's soldiers and followers
never pay!

58
00:06:45,580 --> 00:06:49,460
That's why Grandpa and everyone
else are always angry!

59
00:06:49,500 --> 00:06:53,574
What?! They don't pay?
Is she that stingy, this Queen?

60
00:06:55,180 --> 00:06:57,376
- Watch out!
- If we speak ill of the Queen

61
00:06:57,420 --> 00:07:01,699
the soldiers arrest us! Therefore
it's better not to talk about it at all!

62
00:07:02,020 --> 00:07:04,012
Silence!

63
00:07:04,620 --> 00:07:07,089
You know the Queen's
orders well!

64
00:07:07,140 --> 00:07:10,611
You know what happens to those
who speak ill of her, don't you?

65
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:12,657
Please forgive me!

66
00:07:12,700 --> 00:07:15,169
I only said what
crossed my mind.

67
00:07:15,220 --> 00:07:18,611
Shut up! Shut up! One must not
disobey the laws of Coolland!

68
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:20,612
Forgive me, please!

69
00:07:21,220 --> 00:07:24,213
- Grandpa, you don't have to apologize!
- What do you want to do?

70
00:07:24,340 --> 00:07:27,458
If you really want to know what
I want to do, I'll tell you right now!

71
00:07:27,500 --> 00:07:31,016
- I want to fight you!
- Hurrah!

72
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:37,575
And if you want to hear me
speak ill of the Queen, here you go!

73
00:07:37,620 --> 00:07:41,899
Damn the Queen of Coolland!
She is stupid, fat, and dumb!

74
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:45,292
Curse you!
I won't let you talk like that!

75
00:07:46,500 --> 00:07:48,412
Step forward!

76
00:07:58,540 --> 00:08:00,532
Come at me!

77
00:08:01,940 --> 00:08:03,932
- Hurrah!
- Hurrah!

78
00:08:03,980 --> 00:08:06,779
The soldier of Coolland
isn't as strong as he seems!

79
00:08:06,820 --> 00:08:09,016
He's not strong, he's a coward!

80
00:08:33,820 --> 00:08:35,732
To hell with it!

81
00:08:38,500 --> 00:08:41,493
Get him!
Get him, dead or alive!

82
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:46,098
Stop!

83
00:09:26,301 --> 00:09:30,533
How they exaggerate! It's
as if they were really at war.

84
00:09:31,141 --> 00:09:34,690
Damn! Someone's coming!
Let's hope they don't see me!

85
00:09:38,741 --> 00:09:41,813
Why don't we try
to set a trap for him?

86
00:09:42,421 --> 00:09:44,810
Listen, you, go back to the market immediately.

87
00:09:44,861 --> 00:09:47,216
If the ghost knight
should arrive,

88
00:09:47,261 --> 00:09:50,810
observe him closely and follow him,
but discreetly, understood?

89
00:09:50,861 --> 00:09:53,819
Discreetly,
but you must investigate thoroughly!

90
00:09:53,941 --> 00:09:57,729
- Yes, of course! Alright!
- I think I know that guy.

91
00:09:58,301 --> 00:10:00,337
I see, he was at the market!

92
00:10:00,381 --> 00:10:02,656
I didn't think
there was a spy there too!

93
00:10:02,741 --> 00:10:05,096
That's how they manage
to find out so quickly...

94
00:10:05,141 --> 00:10:08,850
...who speaks ill of the Queen!
What a terrible country!

95
00:10:10,941 --> 00:10:13,774
This is a particularly
delicate moment...

96
00:10:13,821 --> 00:10:15,812
...and we must be
very careful,

97
00:10:15,861 --> 00:10:19,251
because of this new weapon
that we've just made!

98
00:10:20,021 --> 00:10:22,535
So you did it,
the iron lion!

99
00:10:23,381 --> 00:10:26,418
Shut up! Don't speak so loudly!

100
00:10:26,461 --> 00:10:28,895
- You can go now.
- See you!

101
00:10:29,261 --> 00:10:33,812
I'm counting on you, my friends,
work with great care!

102
00:10:35,941 --> 00:10:40,014
- And who are you?
- Come on, Gelo, don't make such a fuss!

103
00:10:40,061 --> 00:10:42,700
Take me to see the new weapon right away!

104
00:10:42,821 --> 00:10:46,496
You must be the ghost knight!

105
00:10:46,541 --> 00:10:48,816
How young you are!
Follow me!

106
00:10:54,141 --> 00:10:56,336
So many barrels are here!

107
00:11:01,141 --> 00:11:05,817
They are all full of the wine needed
for the inhabitants of the castle.

108
00:11:05,861 --> 00:11:08,295
The new weapon is down here!

109
00:11:28,341 --> 00:11:30,901
How strange this underground road is!

110
00:11:31,221 --> 00:11:33,291
It’s coming!

111
00:11:54,661 --> 00:11:57,129
Hey, what is this piece of iron?

112
00:12:00,341 --> 00:12:03,811
What? Do you really
not know it? It’s a train!

113
00:12:03,861 --> 00:12:06,421
Come on, get on with me!

114
00:12:06,861 --> 00:12:11,013
- Are you afraid, ghost knight?
- Of course not!

115
00:12:11,101 --> 00:12:14,491
If I can reach the new weapon
with this train, then I'm getting on!

116
00:12:27,021 --> 00:12:31,139
I think I've seen you
somewhere else before!

117
00:12:31,221 --> 00:12:34,657
No, you're quite mistaken.
It's the first time I've seen you.

118
00:12:52,541 --> 00:12:54,975
Damn, look how fast it's going!

119
00:13:13,901 --> 00:13:15,812
But that's Choppy!

120
00:13:19,741 --> 00:13:21,891
Oh, yeah?! I can jump too!

121
00:13:23,741 --> 00:13:25,413
Down!

122
00:13:32,221 --> 00:13:34,212
And what's this?

123
00:13:47,141 --> 00:13:49,211
The siren!
They're looking for me!

124
00:14:21,901 --> 00:14:25,894
You still haven't found
that damned ghost knight!

125
00:14:25,941 --> 00:14:29,650
Come on, you slackers, look
for him! Search thoroughly!

126
00:14:35,701 --> 00:14:37,976
The Queen is arriving!

127
00:14:51,021 --> 00:14:54,855
Welcome, my Queen!
Welcome, Your Majesty!

128
00:14:55,221 --> 00:14:57,576
Gelo, I thank you for the work you've done!

129
00:14:57,621 --> 00:15:01,455
I heard that you've completed
the new weapon. Where is it?

130
00:15:04,021 --> 00:15:07,570
Take me there immediately,
I'm very impatient to see it.

131
00:15:08,781 --> 00:15:12,820
- Yes, of course!
- It's that way, Majesty!

132
00:15:15,381 --> 00:15:18,976
I'm afraid the ghost knight might arrive!

133
00:15:19,301 --> 00:15:21,212
Move it!

134
00:15:46,701 --> 00:15:49,215
How beautiful!
It's wonderful, Gelo!

135
00:16:07,021 --> 00:16:09,171
And how does this iron lion work?

136
00:16:09,221 --> 00:16:11,371
Would you please explain it to me?

137
00:16:12,021 --> 00:16:15,138
Look at the hole on the lion's forehead!

138
00:16:16,901 --> 00:16:19,290
From that hole, with the power of steam,

139
00:16:19,341 --> 00:16:22,299
- a hundred arrows are being launched!
- A hundred arrows?

140
00:16:22,341 --> 00:16:26,493
Yes! With them we will be able to
break through the walls of any castle!

141
00:16:29,261 --> 00:16:32,412
- Then test it right now!
- Test it?

142
00:16:32,461 --> 00:16:35,692
Line up the prisoners under
the cliff and try to knock it down!

143
00:16:36,341 --> 00:16:39,811
Weapons are completely
useless if they don't kill people!

144
00:16:39,941 --> 00:16:42,296
Let the lion assist
in the execution!

145
00:16:42,501 --> 00:16:45,015
- Send the laziest ones!
- Yes!

146
00:16:46,181 --> 00:16:48,217
How cruel the Queen is!

147
00:16:59,581 --> 00:17:01,572
Oh! Choppy is there too!

148
00:17:02,181 --> 00:17:06,220
Look at him, please! Do you
see how the steam is coming out?

149
00:17:12,021 --> 00:17:15,650
Sapphire, where are you?
Father who art in heaven, help me!

150
00:17:15,701 --> 00:17:17,817
I’m going to die and I don't want to!

151
00:17:18,301 --> 00:17:20,019
Ready...!

152
00:17:30,021 --> 00:17:33,331
- The Ghost Knight!
- The Ghost Knight?!

153
00:17:39,981 --> 00:17:41,972
That's Sapphire! Let's go!

154
00:17:47,221 --> 00:17:49,212
But what are you doing here, Choppy?

155
00:17:49,301 --> 00:17:52,293
Those damn soldiers
brought me here on the train!

156
00:17:53,021 --> 00:17:56,570
- My Queen, are you alright?
- What are you doing?

157
00:17:56,621 --> 00:17:59,613
It's time to put the power
of the iron lion to the test!

158
00:17:59,661 --> 00:18:01,731
Go! Fire the arrows!

159
00:18:11,941 --> 00:18:14,614
What power!
Admirable, Gelo!

160
00:18:14,821 --> 00:18:18,450
The Ghost Knight must
have been blown to pieces!

161
00:18:18,501 --> 00:18:20,969
- I really hope so!
- He is definitely dead!

162
00:18:21,301 --> 00:18:23,815
Anyway,
cursed ghost knight

163
00:18:23,861 --> 00:18:26,898
before dying
you were able to experience my power!

164
00:18:39,181 --> 00:18:43,094
Listen, soldiers,
I beg you to give me your lives!

165
00:18:43,141 --> 00:18:45,894
Fight for the cause
of your Queen!

166
00:18:45,981 --> 00:18:48,211
My heart is always
in your hearts!

167
00:18:48,261 --> 00:18:52,140
Let's go to Silverland! Let's show them
how strong we are!

168
00:19:44,901 --> 00:19:49,019
Stop! Everyone look!
From here we can see Silverland.

169
00:19:49,141 --> 00:19:53,134
As soon as you pass the hill
head inland!

170
00:20:14,341 --> 00:20:16,252
Sapphire, they are coming!

171
00:20:16,301 --> 00:20:19,213
We must prevent the iron lion
from entering Silverland!

172
00:20:22,021 --> 00:20:24,410
Father, mother,
please, protect me.

173
00:20:24,461 --> 00:20:27,259
This arrow
will decide the fate of Silverland!

174
00:20:30,661 --> 00:20:32,538
Sapphire! There it is!

175
00:20:57,021 --> 00:20:59,216
What is happening?
It's turning back!

176
00:20:59,261 --> 00:21:03,732
How is it possible? What are you all doing?
Go forward! Fight!

177
00:21:04,141 --> 00:21:06,450
Hooray!
Well done, it's retreating!

178
00:21:07,221 --> 00:21:10,099
We won!
I beat the iron lion!

179
00:21:29,341 --> 00:21:31,252
Let's retreat!

180
00:22:09,661 --> 00:22:11,572
Choppy!

181
00:22:14,381 --> 00:22:16,292
Choppy!

182
00:22:18,901 --> 00:22:22,291
Choppy is dead!
Choppy, I'm so sorry!

183
00:22:22,501 --> 00:22:25,220
But I'm sure
that you went straight to heaven!

184
00:22:25,261 --> 00:22:28,571
- Sapphire!
- Who is it? Who are you?

185
00:22:32,141 --> 00:22:34,291
- Zelda!
- I have been looking for you for a long time!

186
00:22:34,341 --> 00:22:37,333
I wanted to warn you that your
father and your mother are in danger!

187
00:22:37,421 --> 00:22:39,412
- What?!
- Are they in danger?!

188
00:22:39,741 --> 00:22:43,256
- My father is furious and has
threatened to tear the statues to pieces.

189
00:22:43,341 --> 00:22:45,491
- Oh, God!
- I can't stop him anymore!

190
00:22:45,541 --> 00:22:48,339
My father won't calm
down until you go to him.

191
00:22:48,941 --> 00:22:51,819
- Then I will go at once.
Take me there, Zelda!

192
00:22:52,221 --> 00:22:54,815
- But if you go there, he will
steal your heart, you know it!

193
00:22:54,941 --> 00:22:58,695
- I am prepared for even that!
Take me to the Island of Serpents!

194
00:23:00,141 --> 00:23:02,814
All right.
If you really want to, follow me!

195
00:23:06,301 --> 00:23:10,738
But is Choppy, Sapphire's best friend, really dead?

196
00:23:11,621 --> 00:23:13,498
What will become of Sapphire,

197
00:23:13,541 --> 00:23:17,136
persecuted by the Queen of Coolland and by Satan?

198
00:23:48,061 --> 00:23:51,681
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

199
00:23:51,682 --> 00:23:55,042
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

200
00:23:55,043 --> 00:23:58,813
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

201
00:23:58,814 --> 00:24:01,975
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

202
00:24:01,976 --> 00:24:05,789
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

203
00:24:05,790 --> 00:24:09,086
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

204
00:24:09,087 --> 00:24:13,092
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

205
00:24:13,093 --> 00:24:16,531
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

206
00:24:16,532 --> 00:24:20,152
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

207
00:24:20,153 --> 00:24:23,513
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

208
00:24:23,514 --> 00:24:27,284
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

209
00:24:27,285 --> 00:24:30,446
Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo!
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

210
00:24:30,470 --> 00:24:42,017
Song Lyrics Translation by
